This project packages the mainline Linux kernel for the Redmi Note 11T 5G
(Xiaomi evergo, MediaTek MT6833) and builds a small userspace around it.

License: GPL-2.0

The kernel it builds is Linux, which is GPL-2.0, and the build scripts and
packaging code here follow the same license so the result stays consistent with
the kernel they produce.

Full text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt

Upstream kernel work: https://github.com/KevinLmK0702/linux-evergo (GPL-2.0)
Alpine Linux userland: https://alpinelinux.org (MIT and others)

The vendor device-tree blobs under config/ are extracted from the handset's own
firmware purely so the bootloader accepts the image; they are not covered by the
GPL and are not redistributed as source.
